  ✓ Stage 4: audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, satisfiable preconditions, and concrete substitutions
  ✓ Stage 5: inventory and soundness-check every syntax/function/semantic/proof rule
  ✓ Stage 6: construct and run a fresh reachable false-result mutation
  → Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed facts and write evidence-backed REVIEW.md verdict
